      "ArticleTitle": "[THE BIOLOGICAL FUNCTION OF NUTRITION, BIOLOGICAL REACTION OF EXOTROPHY, DEPOSITING AND ENDOTROPHY. THE VISCERAL FATTY CELLS AND ADIPOCYTES - PHYLOGENETICALLY, FUNCTIONALLY AND REGULATORY DIFFERENT POOLS OF FATTY TISSUE].",
